(https://github.com/henryjeff/portfolio-inner-site), used with his permission. The window-to-URL mapping and the phone
layout follow ideas from Alana Goyal's site (https://github.com/alanagoyal/alanagoyal), MIT licence below.

None of Henry Heffernan's artwork, textures, audio, fonts or icons is included.

